# VOSS: show vlan basic (a starting point - check it against your release's output)
Value VLAN_ID (\d+)
Value NAME (\S+)
Value TYPE (\S+)
Value INST_ID (\S+)
Value PROTOCOL_ID (\S+)
Value SUBNET (\S+)
Value MASK (\S+)
Value VRF (\S+)

Start
  ^${VLAN_ID}\s+${NAME}\s+${TYPE}\s+${INST_ID}\s+${PROTOCOL_ID}\s+${SUBNET}\s+${MASK}\s+${VRF}\s*$$ -> Record
